<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Facture {{ invoice_number }}</title>
    <style>
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

        body {
            font-family: DejaVu Sans, Arial, sans-serif;
            font-size: 11px;
            color: #2d3748;
            background: #fff;
        }

        /* ── En-tête ── */
        .header-table {
            width: 100%;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .brand-name {
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #0d9488;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }
        .brand-tagline {
            font-size: 10px;
            color: #718096;
            margin-top: 4px;
        }
        .company-info {
            font-size: 10px;
            color: #4a5568;
            line-height: 1.7;
            text-align: right;
        }

        /* ── Titre Facture ── */
        .invoice-title {
            background: #0d9488;
            color: #fff;
            padding: 10px 14px;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: bold;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        /* ── Méta (numéro, date) ── */
        .meta-table {
            width: 100%;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }
        .meta-label {
            font-size: 9px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #718096;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            margin-bottom: 2px;
        }
        .meta-value {
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #1a202c;
        }

        /* ── Parties (vendeur / client) ── */
        .parties-table {
            width: 100%;
            margin-bottom: 28px;
        }
        .party-box {
            width: 48%;
            vertical-align: top;
            padding: 12px 14px;
            border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }
        .party-box-right {
            background: #f7fafc;
        }
        .party-title {
            font-size: 9px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #0d9488;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.8px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
            padding-bottom: 5px;
            margin-bottom: 7px;
        }
        .party-name {
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #1a202c;
            margin-bottom: 3px;
        }
        .party-detail {
            font-size: 10px;
            color: #4a5568;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* ── Tableau articles ── */
        .items-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            font-size: 10px;
        }
        .items-table thead tr {
            background: #2d3748;
            color: #fff;
        }
        .items-table thead th {
            padding: 8px 10px;
            text-align: left;
            font-size: 9px;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.4px;
        }
        .items-table thead th.right {
            text-align: right;
        }
        .items-table tbody tr {
            border-bottom: 1px solid #edf2f7;
        }
        .items-table tbody tr:nth-child(even) {
            background: #f7fafc;
        }
        .items-table tbody td {
            padding: 8px 10px;
            vertical-align: middle;
        }
        .items-table tbody td.right {
            text-align: right;
        }
        .items-table tbody td.center {
            text-align: center;
        }
        .sku-badge {
            font-size: 9px;
            color: #718096;
            background: #edf2f7;
            padding: 1px 5px;
            border-radius: 2px;
        }

        /* ── Totaux ── */
        .totals-table {
            width: 100%;
            margin-bottom: 28px;
        }
        .totals-inner {
            width: 260px;
            float: right;
            border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
            border-radius: 4px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .totals-row {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
        }
        .totals-row td {
            padding: 7px 12px;
            font-size: 11px;
        }
        .totals-row tr {
            border-bottom: 1px solid #edf2f7;
        }
        .totals-row tr:last-child {
            border-bottom: none;
        }
        .totals-row .total-label {
            color: #4a5568;
        }
        .totals-row .total-amount {
            text-align: right;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #1a202c;
        }
        .totals-row .ttc-label {
            background: #0d9488;
            color: #fff;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 12px;
        }
        .totals-row .ttc-amount {
            background: #0d9488;
            color: #fff;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 12px;
            text-align: right;
        }
        .clearfix { clear: both; }

        /* ── Adresse facturation ── */
        .billing-section {
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            padding: 10px 14px;
            border-left: 3px solid #0d9488;
            background: #f7fafc;
        }
        .billing-title {
            font-size: 9px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #0d9488;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.8px;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }
        .billing-detail {
            font-size: 10px;
            color: #4a5568;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        /* ── Mentions légales / pied de page ── */
        .footer {
            border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
            padding-top: 12px;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }
        .footer-text {
            font-size: 9px;
            color: #a0aec0;
            line-height: 1.6;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .legal-mentions {
            font-size: 9px;
            color: #718096;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .page-separator {
            margin: 16px 0;
            border: none;
            border-top: 1px dashed #cbd5e0;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- ══ EN-TÊTE SOCIÉTÉ ══ -->
    <table class="header-table" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
        <tr>
            <td style="width:60%; vertical-align:top;">
                <div class="brand-name">ALTHEA</div>
                <div class="brand-tagline">Matériel médical professionnel</div>
            </td>
            <td style="width:40%; vertical-align:top;">
                <div class="company-info">
                    <strong>Althea Systems SAS</strong><br>
                    12 Avenue de la Santé<br>
                    75013 Paris, France<br>
                    SIREN : 123 456 789<br>
                    TVA Intracommunautaire : FR12 123456789<br>
                    contact@althea-systems.com
                </div>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    <!-- ══ TITRE ══ -->
    <div class="invoice-title">FACTURE</div>

    <!-- ══ NUMÉRO / DATE ══ -->
    <table class="meta-table" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
        <tr>
            <td style="width:33%;">
                <div class="meta-label">N° de facture</div>
                <div class="meta-value">{{ invoice_number }}</div>
            </td>
            <td style="width:33%;">
                <div class="meta-label">Date de facturation</div>
                <div class="meta-value">{{ invoice_date|date('d/m/Y') }}</div>
            </td>
            <td style="width:33%;">
                <div class="meta-label">N° commande interne</div>
                <div class="meta-value">#{{ order.id }}</div>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    <!-- ══ VENDEUR / CLIENT ══ -->
    <table class="parties-table" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="6">
        <tr>
            <td class="party-box" style="width:48%;">
                <div class="party-title">Vendeur</div>
                <div class="party-name">Althea Systems SAS</div>
                <div class="party-detail">
                    12 Avenue de la Santé<br>
                    75013 Paris, France<br>
                    SIREN : 123 456 789<br>
                    TVA : FR12 123456789
                </div>
            </td>
            <td style="width:4%;"></td>
            <td class="party-box party-box-right" style="width:48%;">
                <div class="party-title">Client</div>
                {% set user = order.user %}
                {% if user %}
                    <div class="party-name">{{ user.firstName }} {{ user.lastName }}</div>
                    <div class="party-detail">
                        {{ user.email }}<br>
                        {% if user.sirenNumber %}
                            SIREN : {{ user.sirenNumber }}<br>
                        {% endif %}
                        {% if user.phone %}
                            Tél. : {{ user.phone }}
                        {% endif %}
                    </div>
                {% else %}
                    <div class="party-detail">Client inconnu</div>
                {% endif %}
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    <!-- ══ ADRESSE DE FACTURATION ══ -->
    {% set addr = order.addresses %}
    {% if addr %}
        <div class="billing-section">
            <div class="billing-title">Adresse de facturation / livraison</div>
            <div class="billing-detail">
                {{ addr.address }}<br>
                {{ addr.postalCode }} {{ addr.city }}{% if addr.province %}, {{ addr.province }}{% endif %}<br>
                {{ addr.countryCode }}
            </div>
        </div>
    {% endif %}

    <!-- ══ TABLEAU DES ARTICLES ══ -->
    <table class="items-table" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th style="width:12%;">Réf.</th>
                <th style="width:38%;">Désignation</th>
                <th class="right" style="width:8%;">Qté</th>
                <th class="right" style="width:14%;">Prix unitaire HT</th>
                <th class="right" style="width:14%;">TVA {{ tva_rate_pct }}%</th>
                <th class="right" style="width:14%;">Total TTC</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            {% for line in lines %}
                <tr>
                    <td>
                        {% if line.sku %}
                            <span class="sku-badge">{{ line.sku }}</span>
                        {% else %}
                            —
                        {% endif %}
                    </td>
                    <td>{{ line.title }}</td>
                    <td class="center">{{ line.quantity }}</td>
                    <td class="right">{{ line.unit_price_ht|number_format(2, ',', ' ') }} €</td>
                    <td class="right">{{ (line.unit_price_ttc - line.unit_price_ht)|number_format(2, ',', ' ') }} €</td>
                    <td class="right">{{ line.line_ttc|number_format(2, ',', ' ') }} €</td>
                </tr>
            {% else %}
                <tr>
                    <td colspan="6" style="text-align:center; color:#718096; padding:12px;">
                        Aucun article
                    </td>
                </tr>
            {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <!-- ══ TOTAUX ══ -->
    <table class="totals-table" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
        <tr>
            <td>
                <!-- colonne gauche vide pour pousser les totaux à droite -->
            </td>
            <td style="width:260px; vertical-align:top;">
                <table class="totals-row" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width:100%; border:1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius:4px;">
                    <tr>
                        <td class="total-label" style="padding:7px 12px;">Total HT</td>
                        <td class="total-amount" style="padding:7px 12px; text-align:right;">{{ total_ht|number_format(2, ',', ' ') }} €</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td class="total-label" style="padding:7px 12px; border-top:1px solid #edf2f7;">TVA {{ tva_rate_pct }}%</td>
                        <td class="total-amount" style="padding:7px 12px; text-align:right; border-top:1px solid #edf2f7;">{{ total_tva|number_format(2, ',', ' ') }} €</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td style="padding:9px 12px; background:#0d9488; color:#fff; font-weight:bold; font-size:12px;">Total TTC</td>
                        <td style="padding:9px 12px; text-align:right; background:#0d9488; color:#fff; font-weight:bold; font-size:12px;">{{ total_ttc|number_format(2, ',', ' ') }} €</td>
                    </tr>
                </table>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    <!-- ══ MENTIONS LÉGALES ══ -->
    <div class="footer">
        <div class="legal-mentions">
            <strong>Conditions de paiement :</strong> Paiement immédiat par carte bancaire (Stripe).<br>
            <strong>Pénalités de retard :</strong> En cas de retard de paiement, des pénalités de 3 fois le taux d'intérêt légal seront appliquées (article L. 441-10 du Code de commerce), ainsi qu'une indemnité forfaitaire pour frais de recouvrement de 40 €.<br>
            <strong>Escompte :</strong> Aucun escompte consenti en cas de paiement anticipé.
        </div>
        <div class="footer-text">
            Althea Systems SAS — SIREN 123 456 789 — Capital social 10 000 € — RCS Paris B 123 456 789<br>
            Siège social : 12 Avenue de la Santé, 75013 Paris, France — contact@althea-systems.com<br>
            Document généré automatiquement — Facture valable sans signature conformément à l'article 289 du CGI
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
